  message: "RE-CHECK 2026-11-02 on dev ae02786fca (WI-jomik acceptance sweep, after PR #2004: shared resolvers no longer guess among tied candidates; PR #2006: a Rust method call never binds a free function). VERDICT: STILL_REPRODUCES. Repro run: /home/jgstern_agent/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/jomik_member_recheck_11022026/scratch_B/tular: x/defs.bzl defines custom_rule. use.bzl has load(\"//x:defs.bzl\", cr = \"custom_rule\") and def macro(): cr(name=\"b\"). Control use2.bzl has load(\"//x:defs.bzl\", \"custom_rule\") and def macro2(): custom_rule(name=\"c\"). Run with hypergumbo survey.. Observed: calls starlark:use.bzl:3-4:macro:function -> starlark:<unknown>:0-0:cr:external_symbol L4 conf=0.4 res=False. Control: starlark:use2.bzl:3-4:macro2:function -> starlark:x/defs.bzl:1-2:custom_rule:function L4 conf=0.85 res=True.. Note: The filed dst spelling was starlark:external:cr:function. It now prints as starlark:<unknown>:0-0:cr:external_symbol, and the defect (lookup by alias) is the same. Fixtures: /home/jgstern_agent/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/jomik_member_recheck_11022026/scratch_*/."  # 60bf
